<import src="../../ratings/framework7-recovery-common.wxml" />
<view class="screen management-page rating-recovery f7-ios-theme f7-rating-recovery">
  <wu-f7-block class="f7-recovery-content" spacing="compact">
  <view class="management-context">
    <view class="management-context-icon">
      <wu-icon name="refresh" tone="accent" size="22" />
    </view>
    <view class="management-context-copy">
      <view class="context-title">
        {{frozen ? (recoveryOperation || '原操作') : '本账号的操作记录'}}
      </view>
      <view class="meta">
        查看原请求是否已完成
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="notice">
    仅查询当前账号的原请求。目标已隐藏、文字已删除或当前地区不可访问时，仍可恢复已提交的最小回执；不会显示旧正文或把历史分值当作当前评分。
  </view>
  <template is="rating-status" data="{{status,error,receiptStatus,hasSession,frozen,recoveryOperation,busy,needsRefresh}}" />
  <view wx:if="{{loaded &amp;&amp; !frozen}}" class="card">
    {{receiptStatus ? '历史操作结果已确认。请重新进入当前目标读取最新状态。' : '当前账号没有待确认的评分操作。'}}
  </view>
  <view class="management-section" wx:if="{{frozen}}">
    <view class="section-title">
      继续处理原申请
    </view>
    <navigator wx:if="{{frozen}}" class="link management-link" url="/pages/target-owner-edit/target-owner-edit">
      创建者编辑申请恢复与撤销
      <wu-icon name="chevron-right" tone="muted" size="22" />
    </navigator>
    <navigator wx:if="{{frozen}}" class="link management-link" url="/pages/target-owner-delete/target-owner-delete">
      创建者删除申请恢复与撤销
      <wu-icon name="chevron-right" tone="muted" size="22" />
    </navigator>
    <navigator wx:if="{{frozen}}" class="link management-link" url="/pages/rating-category-manage/rating-category-manage?scope=global">
      分类管理原请求：预览、确认与取消
      <wu-icon name="chevron-right" tone="muted" size="22" />
    </navigator>
    <navigator wx:if="{{frozen}}" class="link management-link" url="/pages/rating-category-create/rating-category-create">
      分类创建申请恢复与撤销
      <wu-icon name="chevron-right" tone="muted" size="22" />
    </navigator>
    <navigator wx:if="{{frozen}}" class="link management-link" url="/pages/rating-create/rating-create">
      创建申请恢复与撤销
      <wu-icon name="chevron-right" tone="muted" size="22" />
    </navigator>
  </view>
  <view class="management-section">
    <view class="section-title">
      按功能查询
    </view>
    <navigator class="link management-link" url="/pages/major-discussion-recovery/major-discussion-recovery">
      专业讨论原请求与自己的点赞恢复
      <wu-icon name="chevron-right" tone="muted" size="22" />
    </navigator>
    <navigator class="link management-link" url="/pages/window-discussion-recovery/window-discussion-recovery">
      窗口讨论独立恢复与取消点赞
      <wu-icon name="chevron-right" tone="muted" size="22" />
    </navigator>
    <navigator class="link management-link" url="/pages/window-dishes/window-dishes">
      菜品推荐原请求：独立查询回执与取消
      <wu-icon name="chevron-right" tone="muted" size="22" />
    </navigator>
    <navigator class="link management-link" url="/pages/window-ratings/window-ratings">
      食堂窗口目录、可修改整数评分与原请求恢复
      <wu-icon name="chevron-right" tone="muted" size="22" />
    </navigator>
    <navigator class="link management-link" url="/pages/course-ratings/course-ratings">
      课程目录、首次三维评分与原请求恢复
      <wu-icon name="chevron-right" tone="muted" size="22" />
    </navigator>
    <navigator url="/pages/rating-discussion-media/rating-discussion-media?recovery=1" class="management-link">
      评分图片原请求恢复（旧版本未决优先）
      <wu-icon name="chevron-right" tone="muted" size="22" />
    </navigator>
    <navigator url="/pages/rating-category-manage/rating-category-manage?scope=global" class="management-link">
      分类图标原请求恢复：先查回执，再核验上传与取消
      <wu-icon name="chevron-right" tone="muted" size="22" />
    </navigator>
  </view>
  <view class="management-section">
    <view class="section-title">
      返回评分目录
    </view>
    <navigator class="link management-link" url="/pages/rating-scoped/rating-scoped?mode=catalog&amp;scope=global">
      进入校园范围评分目录
      <wu-icon name="chevron-right" tone="muted" size="22" />
    </navigator>
    <navigator class="link management-link" url="/pages/rating-catalog/rating-catalog">
      重新进入原地区评分目录
      <wu-icon name="chevron-right" tone="muted" size="22" />
    </navigator>
  </view>
  </wu-f7-block>
</view>
